WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.949 --> 00:00:07.970
Thirty-five percent of the people who use
personal ads for dating are already married.

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:18.520
The Vatican City is the only place in the
world where cash machines offer instructions

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:19.520
in Latin.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:25.710
To escape the grip of a crocodile's jaws,
push your thumbs into its eyeballs.

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:28.550
It will let you go instantly.

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:34.160
In France, a five year old child can buy an
alcoholic drink in a bar.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:41.750
It takes a photon 200,000 years to travel
from the core of the Sun to its surface.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:48.260
Then just a little over 8 minutes to travel
from the Sun's surface to your eyeball.

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:55.150
There is a trash vortex in the Pacific Ocean
known as the Great Pacific garbage patch that

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.230
is roughly the size of Texas.

00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:02.100
The average person falls asleep in seven minutes.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:06.939
The national anthem of Greece has 158 verses.

00:01:06.939 --> 00:01:11.039
No one in Greece has memorised the entire
anthem.

00:01:11.039 --> 00:01:16.840
To date Wikipedia has taken about 100 million
man-hours to create.

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:23.859
Which is actually not a lot when you consider
people in the US alone spend about 1.5 billion

00:01:23.859 --> 00:01:27.789
man-hours every month watching TV advertisements.

00:01:27.789 --> 00:01:33.090
A rat can last longer without water than a
camel.

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:37.079
One-fifth of the world's doctors are Russian.

00:01:37.079 --> 00:01:41.719
There are 293 ways to make change out of a
dollar.

00:01:41.719 --> 00:01:49.170
There are only four words in the English language
which end in "dous": tremendous, horrendous,

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.280
stupendous, and hazardous.

00:01:51.280 --> 00:02:00.240
If you view a bald eagle at a zoo, you are
looking at the American symbol of freedom

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:01.240
in captivity.

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:06.939
If you were to be paid $500 in pennies, you
would actually have enough metal to be melted

00:02:06.939 --> 00:02:19.780
down and sold for over $1,000.

